  "notes": "Plant name/unit not present in FORM-366 FIELDS identity block but clearly identified in narrative header as 'Fermi 2', docket 05000341 which corresponds to Fermi Unit 2. No SSC was inoperable at event start. Leak likely existed undetected since 6/10/2022 within TS-permitted bounds until identified 8/20/2023, triggering both a prohibited-condition report (TS 3.4.4.a violation, no pressure boundary leakage allowed) and a seriously-degraded-barrier report. No backup systems modeled since RR sample line leak is a small-bore piping leak mitigated by normal LOCA response capability, not by a specific named operable backup system in the narrative. Previous occurrences: narrative explicitly states none in the last 23 years, so no stub LER node is created per instructions (no specific referenced LER to stub)."
